                "text": "Thirty million kids will now have access to the food they need over summer vacation.\n\nI joined @DepSecXoch at Mission Elementary to celebrate the permanent start of Summer EBT, which will ensure kids can get the nutrition benefits they need when schools close for the summer. https://t.co/1diYFOSeMw",
